<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <title>Loan Completion Notification</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #333;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 20px;
        }
        .header {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 20px 0;
            background-color: #f8f9fa;
            border-radius: 5px;
        }
        .content {
            padding: 20px;
            background-color: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 5px;
            margin-top: 20px;
        }
        .details {
            margin: 20px 0;
            padding: 15px;
            background-color: #f8f9fa;
            border-radius: 5px;
        }
        .transactions {
            margin: 20px 0;
            padding: 15px;
            background-color: #f8f9fa;
            border-radius: 5px;
        }
        .transaction-row {
            padding: 10px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;
        }
        .transaction-row:last-child {
            border-bottom: none;
        }
        .footer {
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 20px;
            padding-top: 20px;
            border-top: 1px solid #eee;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #666;
        }
        .highlight {
            color: #2c5282;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
        .success {
            color: #38a169;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
        table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            margin: 15px 0;
        }
        th, td {
            padding: 8px;
            text-align: left;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd;
        }
        th {
            background-color: #f8f9fa;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="header">
        <h1>Loan Completion Notification</h1>
    </div>

    <div class="content">
        <p>Dear {{name}},</p>

        <p class="success">Congratulations! Your loan has been successfully paid off.</p>

        <div class="details">
            <h3>Loan Summary</h3>
            <p><span class="highlight">Loan ID:</span> {{loanId}}</p>
            <p><span class="highlight">Account Number:</span> {{accountNumber}}</p>
            <p><span class="highlight">Original Loan Amount:</span> ${{loanAmount}}</p>
            <p><span class="highlight">Interest Rate:</span> {{interestRate}}%</p>
            <p><span class="highlight">Total Interest Paid:</span> ${{totalInterest}}</p>
            <p><span class="highlight">Total Amount Paid:</span> ${{totalAmount}}</p>
            <p><span class="highlight">Loan Term:</span> {{term}} months</p>
            <p><span class="highlight">Completion Date:</span> {{completionDate}}</p>
        </div>

        <div class="transactions">
            <h3>Payment History</h3>
            <table>
                <thead>
                    <tr>
                        <th>Date</th>
                        <th>Amount</th>
                        <th>Type</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    {{#each transactions}}
                    <tr class="transaction-row">
                        <td>{{this.date}}</td>
                        <td>${{this.amount}}</td>
                        <td>{{this.type}}</td>
                    </tr>
                    {{/each}}
                </tbody>
            </table>
        </div>

        <p>Thank you for your timely payments and for choosing our services. We appreciate your business!</p>

        <p>If you need any assistance or have questions about your account, please don't hesitate to contact our customer service team.</p>

        <p>Best regards,<br>TNGS SACCO</p>
    </div>

    <div class="footer">
        <p>This is an automated message, please do not reply directly to this email.</p>
        <p>© {{currentYear}} TNGS SACCO. All rights reserved.</p>
    </div>
</body>
</html> 